DESCRIPTION:Organized by the International Society for Engineering Health (
	ISEH)—dedicated to preserving health and eliminating disease—with Rice Uni
	versity serving as the Inaugural Academic Host and Lead Sponsor\, this fir
	st annual summit brings together leaders in medicine\, engineering\, scien
	ce\, industry\, government\, and patient advocacy to identify the challeng
	ing diseases most ready for elimination and to launch the first ISEH initi
	atives. Diseases to be discussed include: stroke\, pancreatic cancer\, sch
	izophrenia\, monogenic diseases\, Alzheimer's disease and sepsis.  Become 
	an ISEH member (https://us.list-manage.com/1CRcsItz7Pw?e=06ace55deb&amp\;c
