SUMMARY:Reading Group Session 1a
DTSTAMP:20260805T111504Z
DTSTART:20260915T171500Z
DESCRIPTION:The Reading Group (https://cte.rice.edu/programs/reading-group)
	 is open to all faculty\, staff\, and graduate students at Rice and is a t
